  "narrative": {
    "intro": "M1 Support Services L P has federal contract obligations of $680M in FY2026 to date. M1 Support Services L P received 15 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $45.3M. M1 Support Services L P's obligations are down 29.8% year over year. M1 Support Services L P's fiscal-year obligations ranged from $831M in FY21 to $969M in FY25 before the current-year total of $680M in FY26. M1 Support Services L P's largest market in FY2026 to date is Other Support Activities for Air Transportation at $653M, followed by Aircraft Manufacturing at $27.4M. The current-year totals are partial and represent fiscal year to date obligations.",
